OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry and bright with good
OL,6,Fsunny spells, but somewhat cloudier in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon with the chance of the
OL,8,Fodd light shower. Fresh winds at first
OL,9,Fwill become light by afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with some bright spells at
OL,13,Ffirst, but then patchy rain spreading
OL,14,Fnorth overnight. Freshening southerly
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FOutbreaks of rain in the
OL,18,Fmorning then dry for a time before
OL,19,Ffurther showers in the evening. Fresh
OL,20,Fto strong southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
