OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells at first Monday, strengthening
OL,7,Fsouthwesterly winds and occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy showers later. Occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy rain or showers on Tuesday with
OL,10,Fstrong to gale force winds, this
OL,11,Fclearing through Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
